pkg:Evidence_v1_1_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.1.0 (MINOR release)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR release responding to two user-identified gaps in v1.0.0. (1) Stage 3 shipped as an ABox only; the procedure's own SS2.2 step 6 requires a companion DOCX/PDF render, which v1.0.0 omitted. Added code_abundance_document_v1_1_0.docx, generated programmatically from the same TTL (no re-authoring), verified by LibreOffice conversion + visual page inspection. (2) The v1.0.0 interactive page was gate-conformant but did not match this ecosystem's own documented visual/interaction standard (see rdodi-ecosystem/05-documentation/RDODI_interactive_page_standard_analysis_v1_0_0.md's own admission that 'conformance discipline is being mistaken for design discipline'). Rebuilt the page reusing the ecosystem's actual reference CSS/JS (ch10_quality_companion_interactive_v4_0_0.html's typography, color system, hero, sticky topbar with scroll-spy) and added a second, distinct widget primitive -- a citation-verification status bar, data-driven from the Stage 1 quality scorecard -- for genuine visual/interaction density beyond the reveal-toggle pattern alone. All 6 mechanical Stage4/Cross gates and all 3 widget gates re-verified PASS (16 widgets now, up from 15). Real Playwright verification: 0 console errors, 0 modal dialogs, 21/21 sections in DOM, 15/15 reveal-widget interactions passed, the new status bar's rendered aria-label and text independently read from the live DOM and confirmed to state the correct 13/1/1 breakdown. Disclosed interpretive choice: the top navigation lists the 6 H1 (major) sections, not all 21 sections including H2 leaves -- read as satisfying BP-D34's 'identifies all major sections' at the heading-level-1 granularity, verified reachable at a 390px mobile viewport without scrolling the nav itself; the 15 leaf sections remain reachable by scroll within their parent, not by a second click."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "028154f6c541456fc56f3c2b88706b6923473b704784516fdb9cd1b0c3c58d2f"^^xsd:string .
